        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A living enemy you can see within 60 feet is reduced to 0 Hit Points.</p><hr /><p>As a creature slips into that final darkness, you tear through the fabric of reality to release the shadows of the Netherworld. Each creature in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] from the triggering enemy takes 4d8 cold] damage with a basic Reflex save. On a failure, a creature also takes @Damage[(@item.level - 3)d6[persistent,cold]|options:area-damage] damage (double on a critical failure).</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the cold damage by 1d8 and the persistent cold damage by 1d6</p>"
